    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77613" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντῃ</span></b>  (<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
