					<u>Lex.Mess.</u>
					p.409
				</span></i>
			, and so written in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PEleph.</u>
				1.14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv B. C.)</span>), 
				Dor.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παντᾷ</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				1.117
